<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean union postpones strikes set for Feb 18.</title>
<headline>S.Korean union postpones strikes set for Feb 18.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's outlawed labour union said on Thursday it decided to postpone strikes till after it sees how parliament handles the revision of a controversial new labour law.</p>
<p>The union said the strikes would now start between February 24-28. They had originally been scheduled to begin on February 18.</p>
